cessible name when the visible content is incomplete."],[342,"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"],[357,"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."],[1777,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[410,"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."],[420,"`CollapsiblePanel` is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."],[421,"`CollapsiblePanel` uses `role=\"group\"` by default. Keep it when the panel's content does not need\na navigation landmark; there is no need to set it explicitly."],[412,"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."],[2034,"`colorIndex` pins each series to a palette color. Any series can use any index,\nindependently — here two pairs each share an index so an actual line and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."],[1093,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[666,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[669,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[665,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[667,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[668,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[670,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1437,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[459,"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"],[1587,"`Detail` is supporting copy, such as captions and metadata, on the detail ramp. It keeps the\nsurrounding color; add `emphasis=\"passive\"` to mute it."],[493,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[587,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[1578,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[1586,"`emphasis` selects a feedback color and changes nothing else. Without it, text inherits the\nsurrounding color."],[1024,"`Enter/Space`"],[60,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[417,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[535,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[744,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[502,"`Escape`"],[950,"`Escape`"],[1026,"`Escape`"],[1782,"`Escape`"],[572,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."],[2068,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[674,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[2141,"`Grid` is a two-dimensional CSS Grid layout component for complex grid-based layouts. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[589,"`Heading` renders a semantic `h1`-`h6` element via the `level` prop.\nInside a `Modal`/`Dialog`, add `slot=\"title\"` and it labels the dialog automatically."],[424,"`Icon slot=\"indicator\"` is decorative and receives `aria-hidden=\"true\"` automatically."],[732,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a 